  "description": "Not a published list: Lunar Stage 6's (FFG F8) deck for Tennin Institute: The Secrets Within, on Zyzzyva's list, so the sweeps meet a Corp that advances a card when the Runner made no successful run on their last turn. It carries the stage's Jinteki and neutral cards: Cerebral Cast for a Kakurenbo, Mental Health Clinic and Chairman Hiro for two Project Junebug, Tenma Line for a Daruma, Medical Research Fundraiser for an Aimor, Fast Track for a Whirlpool, and the agendas point for point, Encrypted Portals for Water Monopoly, Philotic Entanglement for Braintrust and Hades Fragment for Fujii Asset Retrieval; Zyzzyva and other decks keep every card swapped out. Eternal-legal only. Spin Stages 1 to 4 (FFG F10) swapped in Tsurugi, Shinobi and Shock! for a Mlinzi, Otoroshi and Sadaka, which other decks keep.",
